<%- include('partials/header') -%>

<section class="py-40 lg:py-40">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-6">
                <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                    <div class="text-center mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-7xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
                        <p class="text-text-secondary mt-2">Effective Date: [Insert Date]</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-8">
                        <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-lg shadow-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6">This Privacy Policy explains how <strong class="text-text-primary">Nanshhuf</strong> (“we”, “our”, “us”, or the “Site”) collects, uses, shares, and safeguards your personal information when you visit our website, place an order, or interact with our services (together, the “Services”).</p>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">By accessing or using our Services, you agree to this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the Site immediately.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-lg shadow-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                            <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mb-4">Updates to This Policy</h3>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">We may update or revise this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect operational, legal, or regulatory changes. Any modifications will be posted on this page with a revised “Last Updated” date.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-lg shadow-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                            <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mb-4">Information We Collect</h3>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">We collect personal information in the following ways:</p>
                            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-4 mb-4 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-4">
                                <li class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Information You Provide Directly
                                    <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 mt-2 space-y-2 font-normal">
                                        <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, billing and shipping address.</li>
                                        <li><strong>Account Details:</strong> Username, password, and login credentials.</li>
                                        <li><strong>Order Details:</strong> Items purchased, payment confirmation, delivery details.</li>
                                        <li><strong>Support Requests:</strong> Messages and information shared when you contact customer service.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </li>
                                <li class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Information Collected Automatically
                                    <p class="mt-2 font-normal">Through cookies, pixels, and similar technologies, we may collect:</p>
                                    <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 mt-2 space-y-2 font-normal">
                                        <li>Device and browser details.</li>
                                        <li>IP address and general location data.</li>
                                        <li>Interaction data such as pages visited, cart activity, and clicks.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </li>
                                 <li class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Information from Third Parties
                                    <p class="mt-2 font-normal">We may receive personal information from:</p>
                                    <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 mt-2 space-y-2 font-normal">
                                        <li>Payment processors to complete transactions.</li>
                                        <li>Delivery partners for shipping.</li>
                                        <li>Marketing and analytics providers to improve our services.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-lg shadow-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                            <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mb-4">How We Use Your Information</h3>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">We use your personal information for:</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-4">
                                <li><strong>Order Fulfillment:</strong> Processing payments, shipping, and providing customer support.</li>
                                <li><strong>Account Management:</strong> Enabling login, order history, and wishlist features.</li>
                                <li><strong>Marketing & Communication:</strong> Sending promotional offers, newsletters, and service updates (with your consent).</li>
                                <li><strong>Security & Fraud Prevention:</strong> Monitoring suspicious activity and protecting our platform.</li>
                                <li><strong>Service Improvement:</strong> Analyzing site usage to optimize our offerings and customer experience.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-lg shadow-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                           <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mb-4">Cookies & Tracking</h3>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Our Site uses cookies to improve functionality, remember your preferences, and analyze traffic. You may disable cookies through your browser, but some features of the Site may not function properly.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-lg shadow-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                           <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mb-4">Sharing of Information</h3>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">We may share your personal information only in limited circumstances:</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-4">
                                <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> With vendors who help us with payment processing, order fulfillment, hosting, and analytics.</li>
                                <li><strong>Business Partners:</strong> For promotions, advertising, and marketing (in line with your preferences).</li>
                                <li><strong>Legal Obligations:</strong> When required by law or to protect our legal rights.</li>
                                <li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In the event of a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-4">We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-lg shadow-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                            <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mb-4">Data Security</h3>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information. However, no online system is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute protection.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-lg shadow-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                            <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mb-4">Your Rights</h3>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Depending on your location, you may have rights to:</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-4">
                                <li>Access, correct, or delete your personal information.</li>
                                <li>Withdraw consent for marketing communications.</li>
                                <li>Request details about how we process your data.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-4">To exercise these rights, please contact us (details below).</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-lg shadow-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                           <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mb-4">Contact Us</h3>
                            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">If you have any questions, concerns, or complaints about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, you can reach us at:</p>
                            <div class="mt-4 p-6 bg-accent-brown/10 rounded-lg">
                                 <p class="flex items-center text-text-secondary"><i data-lucide="mail" class="w-5 h-5 mr-3 text-accent-brown"></i> <a href="mailto:privacy@nanshhuf.com" class="hover:underline text-accent-brown font-semibold">nanshhuf@gmail.com</a></p>
                                 <p class="flex items-center mt-2 text-text-secondary"><i data-lucide="phone" class="w-5 h-5 mr-3 text-accent-brown"></i> <a href="tel:+1234567890" class="hover:underline text-accent-brown font-semibold">+91 9167864208</a></p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

